---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Person",
      "@id": "https://pravinemani.com/#person",
      "name": "Pravine Manivannan",
      "url": "https://pravinemani.com/",
      "image": "https://pravinemani.com/og-default.png",
      "jobTitle": "AI, SEO & Marketing Automation Consultant",
      "description": "Toronto freelance AI engineer. McMaster Computer Engineering & Management graduate. Independent consultancy since February 2026 across AI workflows, programmatic SEO + GEO, and marketing automation.",
      "alumniOf": { "@type": "CollegeOrUniversity", "name": "McMaster University" },
      "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress", "addressLocality": "Toronto", "addressCountry": "Canada" },
      "sameAs": [
        "https://github.com/pravinemani5545",
        "https://www.linkedin.com/in/pravinemani/",
        "https://x.com/pravinemani",
        "https://aiopsforge.dev"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://pravinemani.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://pravinemani.com/about/" }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---

<Base title="About · Pravine Mani · Toronto Freelance AI Engineer" description="Toronto freelance AI engineer. McMaster CE & Management graduate. Engineering background at Ericsson, Imprimo, Fixvi. Independent since February 2026 across AI workflows, SEO + GEO, marketing automation." jsonLd={jsonLd}>


<section class="page-hero about-hero">
  <div class="breadcrumb"><span class="gr">$</span> cat ~/about.md <span class="you">→ pravine mani</span></div>
  <div class="about-hero-grid">
    <div class="about-hero-text">
      <h1>Freelance AI engineer.<br><span class="accent">Building AI-native. Toronto.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">I build AI, SEO, and marketing automation for founders, agency owners, and ops leads. <strong>Engineering since 2022. Freelance since February 2026.</strong> Engagements run on fixed scope, with a written quote inside 24 hours.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-portrait">
      <figure class="portrait-frame">
        <div class="portrait-chrome">
          <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="tag">~/identity</span>
          <span class="live">● LIVE</span>
        </div>
        <img
          src="/about-photo.jpg"
          alt="Pravine Manivannan. Toronto-based AI, SEO, and marketing automation consultant"
          width="400"
          height="400"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
          class="portrait-img"
        />
        <figcaption class="portrait-meta">
          <span>PRAVINE MANIVANNAN</span>
          <span class="gr">TORONTO</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <div class="bio-grid">

    <div class="bio-main">
      <h2>How I got here.</h2>
      <p>The background is engineering. <strong>5G software at Ericsson</strong> in Go and gRPC, full-stack work at Imprimo with React Native and Postgres, and mobile push-notification work at Fixvi. McMaster Computer Engineering and Management.</p>
      <p>I built independent Next.js and Supabase projects on weekends through school. <strong>In 2024</strong> Claude Code shortened the loop from idea to production, and paid AI workflow engagements for indie founders followed.</p>
      <p>In 2025, <strong>CISNET</strong>, a Toronto IT certification training company, hired me to move their site off legacy PHP onto Next.js 16. The work covered 200 SEO pages, 70 redirects, seven types of structured data for search, a custom admin portal, Stripe checkout, and a Facebook Lead Ads pipeline. Three months, solo, shipped Q4 2025.</p>
      <p>2026 is the consultancy. <a href="/services/">Five engagement shapes</a>: a free 30-minute scoping call, a fixed-scope audit week, a fixed-scope build sprint, a milestone-paid custom build, and an ops retainer for maintenance. Each paid engagement is quoted on scope, with a written spec before signing. The adjacent project, <strong>AIOpsForge</strong>, is a community for solo AI builders, in pre-launch at <a href="https://aiopsforge.dev">aiopsforge.dev</a>.</p>

      <h2>How I work.</h2>
      <p><strong>Code-first.</strong> Every automation ships as code in the client's repo, versioned in git, deployed to the client's Vercel account, and debuggable through standard logs. Vercel cron jobs and serverless functions, not a visual no-code platform.</p>
      <p><strong>Written-first.</strong> Each engagement opens with a written spec both sides agree on. Each milestone closes with a recorded Loom and a written summary. Live calls at kickoff, milestone demos, and the closing retro. Everything else runs async.</p>
      <p><strong>Owned outright.</strong> At the end, the client gets the repo, environment variables, deployment access, and docs. Nothing stays in my account.</p>

      <h2>What I don't do.</h2>
      <p>No graphic design, data science, customer-service chatbots, safety or alignment research, or full-time employment. I don't patch existing n8n, Make, or Zapier setups; I rewrite them in code on the client's own infrastructure. Solo by choice.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bio-side">
      <div class="fact-card">
        <div class="label">PROFILE</div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">BASED</span><span class="v">Toronto · ET</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">EDUCATION</span><span class="v">McMaster Comp Eng &amp; Management</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">SHIPPING SINCE</span><span class="v">2022</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">AVAILABILITY</span><span class="v"><span class="acc">Open</span> · taking new engagements</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="fact-card">
        <div class="label">HOW I OPERATE</div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">PRICING</span><span class="v">Fixed scope · written quote in 24 hrs</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">DEFAULT</span><span class="v">Async · Loom + email</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">LIVE CALLS</span><span class="v">Kickoff · milestone · retro only</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">OWNERSHIP</span><span class="v">Repo + env + deploys hand off at close</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">SUBCONTRACT</span><span class="v"><span class="acc">Never</span></span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="fact-card">
        <div class="label">STACK · SHORT VERSION</div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">DEV</span><span class="v">Claude Code · Vercel · TypeScript</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">AI</span><span class="v">Anthropic API · MCP · Claude 4.7</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">DATA</span><span class="v">Supabase · Vercel KV · Stripe</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">CONTENT</span><span class="v">Beehiiv · Plausible · Resend</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">FULL LIST</span><span class="v"><a href="/stack/" style="color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green);">/stack →</a></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="now-block" id="now">
    <div class="now-block-head">
      <div class="label">CURRENTLY</div>
      <h2>What I'm focused on.</h2>
      <p>Current engagements, recent ships, open capacity. Updated as things change.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="now-grid">
      <div class="now-panel">
        <div class="now-panel-head"><span class="lab">PRIMARY</span><span class="meta">TAKING WORK</span></div>
        <h3>Independent consulting across AI workflows, SEO, and marketing automation.</h3>
        <p>Engagements with founders, agency owners, and ops leads. Fixed scope, fixed price. Async audit at <a href="/workflow-audit/">/workflow-audit</a>. Scoping call at <a href="/contact/">/contact</a>.</p>
        <p>Adjacent work: <strong>AIOpsForge</strong>, a community for solo AI operators, in pre-launch at <a href="https://aiopsforge.dev">aiopsforge.dev</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="now-panel">
        <div class="now-panel-head"><span class="lab">SHIPPED</span><span class="meta">RECENT</span></div>
        <div class="week-rail">
          <div class="item done"><span class="day">CISNET</span><span class="what">Next.js 16 migration. 200+ SEO pages. Custom admin portal. Lead pipeline. Q4 2025.</span><span class="check">✓</span></div>
          <div class="item done"><span class="day">PORTFOLIO</span><span class="what">This site. Astro 6 + Tailwind v4. Async audit funnel, structured data across 20 routes.</span><span class="check">✓</span></div>
          <div class="item done"><span class="day">OSS</span><span class="what">skills-and-mcp published. 3 reusable Claude Code skills, installable via curl.</span><span class="check">✓</span></div>
          <div class="item done"><span class="day">AOF</span><span class="what">aiopsforge.dev built. Whop checkout wired. Waitlist live.</span><span class="check">✓</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="yr"><span class="year">2026</span><span class="what"><strong>Independent consultancy</strong> across AI workflows, SEO, and marketing automation. AIOpsForge in pre-launch.</span></div>
    <div class="yr"><span class="year">2025</span><span class="what"><strong>CISNET</strong> shipped Q4. Next.js 16 migration, 200+ SEO pages, custom admin portal, Stripe checkout, lead pipeline. Three months, solo.</span></div>
    <div class="yr"><span class="year">2024</span><span class="what">Adopted <strong>Claude Code</strong> as primary dev surface. First paid AI workflow engagements for indie founders.</span></div>
    <div class="yr"><span class="year">2023</span><span class="what">Full-stack work at <strong>Imprimo</strong> (React Native, Postgres). Mobile work at <strong>Fixvi</strong> (push notifications). Independent Next.js + Supabase builds in parallel.</span></div>
    <div class="yr"><span class="year">2022</span><span class="what">5G software at <strong>Ericsson</strong> (Go, gRPC). First independent Next.js + TypeScript + Supabase deployments.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-cta reveal" style="text-align: center;">
    <p style="margin: 0;">More on what I build: <a href="/services/" style="color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green);">/services</a> · or the <a href="/contact/" style="color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green);">contact page →</a></p>
  </div>

</section>


</Base>
<style is:global>
.bio-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }
.bio-main { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
.bio-main h3 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-top: 16px; }
.bio-main h3:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.bio-main p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 680px; }
.bio-main p strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
.bio-main p a { color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green); }
.bio-side { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
.fact-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 22px 24px; position: relative; }
.fact-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--card-accent, var(--green)); opacity: 0.8; }
.fact-card .label { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.fact-card .item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 13px; }
.fact-card .item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.fact-card .item .k { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.fact-card .item .v { color: var(--text-primary); }
.fact-card .item .v .acc { color: var(--green); }
.fact-card:nth-of-type(1) { --card-accent: var(--green); }
.fact-card:nth-of-type(2) { --card-accent: var(--red); }
.fact-card:nth-of-type(3) { --card-accent: #a855f7; }
.timeline { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 24px 28px; margin-top: 24px; }
.timeline .yr { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr; gap: 18px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); align-items: baseline; }
.timeline .yr:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.timeline .yr .year { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--green); font-weight: 500; }
.timeline .yr .what { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; }
.timeline .yr .what strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
@media (max-width: 980px) { .bio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* About bio H2 (was h3 before) */
.bio-main h2 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin-top: 20px; line-height: 1.2; }
.bio-main h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

/* About hero. 2-col on desktop, photo on the right */
.about-hero-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
  gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px);
  align-items: center;
  margin-top: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px);
}
.about-hero-text h1 { margin-bottom: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 24px); }
.about-hero-text .lead { max-width: 56ch; margin-bottom: 0; }
@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .about-hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
  .about-hero-text { order: 1; }
  .about-portrait { order: 2; }
}

/* About portrait */
.about-portrait { margin-top: 0; max-width: 440px; width: 100%; justify-self: center; }
.portrait-frame { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.portrait-frame::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--green); opacity: 0.85; }
.portrait-frame .portrait-chrome {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--bg-tertiary);
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--text-dim); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.portrait-frame .portrait-chrome .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: var(--border); display: inline-block; }
.portrait-frame .portrait-chrome .tag { margin-left: 6px; flex: 1; }
.portrait-frame .portrait-chrome .live { color: var(--green); }
.portrait-img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  object-fit: cover;
  filter: contrast(1.02) saturate(0.95);
  background: var(--bg-tertiary);
}
.portrait-meta {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.portrait-meta .gr { color: var(--green); font-size: 9px; }

/* About bottom CTA */
.about-cta { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-card) 0%, var(--bg-tertiary) 100%); border: 1px solid var(--border-green); padding: 44px 36px; text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 32px; }
.about-cta::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center top, rgba(0,255,65,0.06) 0%, transparent 60%); pointer-events: none; }
.about-cta > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.about-cta h2 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 34px); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.about-cta h2 .accent { color: var(--green); }
.about-cta p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 17px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; max-width: 580px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

/* "Right now" merged section (was /now/ page) */
.now-block { margin-top: 36px; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 32px); position: relative; scroll-margin-top: 92px; }
.now-block::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--green); opacity: 0.85; }
.now-block-head { margin-bottom: 22px; padding-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.now-block-head .label { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.now-block-head h2 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(22px, 1.9vw, 30px); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.018em; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.now-block-head p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.55; max-width: 64ch; }
.now-block-head p a { color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green); }

.now-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr; gap: 18px; }
@media (max-width: 880px) { .now-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.now-panel { background: var(--bg-tertiary); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.now-panel-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.now-panel-head .lab { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; }
.now-panel-head .meta { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--text-dim); text-transform: uppercase; }
.now-panel h3 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.25; }
.now-panel p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
.now-panel p strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
.now-panel p a { color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green); }

.week-rail { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.week-rail .item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr auto; gap: 14px; align-items: center; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 13.5px; }
.week-rail .item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.week-rail .item .day { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--text-dim); text-transform: uppercase; }
.week-rail .item.done .day { color: var(--green); }
.week-rail .item.now .day { color: #ffd84a; }
.week-rail .item .what { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.45; }
.week-rail .item.done .what { color: var(--text-primary); }
.week-rail .item.now .what { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 600; }
.week-rail .item .what strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
.week-rail .item .check { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim); }
.week-rail .item.done .check { color: var(--green); }
.week-rail .item.now .check { color: #ffd84a; }
</style>
